From 1a4335fd0e142840a55d7d09096bae282431d62f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 09:29:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] win32u, winewayland: Preserve fullscreen swapchain image
 enumeration.

Resolve fullscreen requests to their Wayland output before storing them.
This prevents the initial window update from changing the target and
invalidating the swapchain immediately after creation.

Keep vkGetSwapchainImagesKHR independent of presentation freshness.
Vulkan does not permit VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DATE_KHR from that command and
swapchain images remain enumerable until the swapchain is destroyed.

(cherry picked from commit 1a4335fd0e142840a55d7d09096bae282431d62f)

[ GE-Proton adaptation: imported only the vkGetSwapchainImagesKHR change. The
  fullscreen-request half of the upstream commit operates on
  struct wayland_fullscreen_request tracking, which this base does not have. ]

Source: https://github.com/nanomatters/wine-salkim/commit/1a4335fd0e142840a55d7d09096bae282431d62f
---
 dlls/win32u/vulkan.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c b/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
index d6bdc34a1f1..27c0a9a1a0c 100644
--- a/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
@@ -4057,7 +4057,7 @@ static VkResult win32u_vkGetSwapchainImagesKHR( VkDevice client_device, VkSwapch
     struct swapchain *swapchain = swapchain_from_handle( client_swapchain );
     uint32_t i;
 
-    if (!swapchain) return VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DATE_KHR;
+    if (!swapchain) return VK_ERROR_UNKNOWN;
 
     if (swapchain->managed)
     {
